            "x": 64,
            "y": 1500,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nThe connected account must be a **site administrator** (users and groups). The flow adds the first user returned by Find Users to its own temporary group and removes them again. It creates the user `e2e-tableau-<timestamp>@example.com` as Viewer (Tableau makes it Unlicensed when no licence is left), changes it to Unlicensed and deletes it; on Tableau Cloud an invitation is sent to that example.com address."
